OL,3,GNEWSADerelict council office block for
OL,4,Asale from #600k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seven-storey former council office
OL,7,Fblock is going up for auction with a
OL,8,Fguide price of #600,000.
OL,10,FRoebuck House in Abbey Road, Torquay,
OL,11,Fwas constructed in 1971 and was used as
OL,12,Fcouncil offices and a Job Centre but is
OL,13,Fthought to have been empty since 2013.
OL,15,FIt was the site of a triple murder in
OL,16,FOctober 1974 when gunman Michael
OL,17,FAnthony Brown, who was wrongly
OL,18,Fconvinced Job Centre staff were mocking
OL,19,Fhim, killed John Leggo, 25, Sally Yeo,
OL,20,F25, and Kenneth Watkins, 40, before
OL,21,Fturning the shotgun on himself.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
